    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High specification picture! Wonderful music!! With grand SCENES!! Neither exists in this game \uff1a\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Don't block road!&gt; is a light-hearted puzzle game. You will accompany the lovable characters &quot;Iggy&quot; and &quot;Java&quot; on their journey through various scenarios and rich puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any questions or feedback, you can leave something in the steam community and I will actively communicate with players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Features: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Pixel style art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Rich puzzle levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Witty dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game play\uff1a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character moves on its own</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583590/extras/fd688f8bb8eb08072203973bcf84279d.poster.avif?t=1752921022\" width=598 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583590/extras/fd688f8bb8eb08072203973bcf84279d.webm?t=1752921022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583590/extras/fd688f8bb8eb08072203973bcf84279d.mp4?t=1752921022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use stone to build Bridges and roads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583590/extras/4b4ca0d7f01af7f23df28835771f3b02.poster.avif?t=1752921022\" width=598 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583590/extras/4b4ca0d7f01af7f23df28835771f3b02.webm?t=1752921022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583590/extras/4b4ca0d7f01af7f23df28835771f3b02.mp4?t=1752921022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Spin stones for more levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583590/extras/b0a7dc3c460e9114fa594ed8fa4e574a.poster.avif?t=1752921022\" width=598 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583590/extras/b0a7dc3c460e9114fa594ed8fa4e574a.webm?t=1752921022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583590/extras/b0a7dc3c460e9114fa594ed8fa4e574a.mp4?t=1752921022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
